---
source: crates/mnemic/tests/cli.rs
expression: stdout
---
Mnemic

Usage: mnemic <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check   Check core frontmatter in a vault or one note
  init    Scaffold a vault in the target directory
  log     Append one timeline line to a note
  search  Search parsed notes. Tokens are literal and combined with AND
  get     Print one note by id, slug, alias, or vault-relative path
  links   List outgoing links, backlinks, and broken links for one note
  new     Create a note from a type template
  mv      Move or rename a note and rewrite incoming wikilinks
  use     Show or set the default vault
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
